      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Bronze. Povos antigos acreditavam que o padrão nas costas de Bronzor escondia um poder misterioso. Exemplares deste Pokémon já foram encontrados em tumbas antigas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Mineral &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Bronzor pode evoluir para Bronzong no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confusion, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Hypnosis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Confuse Ray</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Psywave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Feint Attack, Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Future Sight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Metal Sound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Gyro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Extrasensory</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Heal Block, Heavy Slam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Confuse Ray, Double Team, Dream Eater, Earthquake, Endure, Expanding Force, Facade, Flash Cannon, Frustration, Future Sight, Grass Knot, Gravity, Guard Swap, Gyro Ball, Heavy Slam, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Ice Spinner, Imprison, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Light Screen, Metal Sound, Payback, Power Gem, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Blast, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Sandstorm, Shadow Ball, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Speed Swap, Stealth Rock, Steel Beam, Steel Roller, Stomping Tantrum, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Take D o w n, T e le k i n esis, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Ze n H e a d b u t t</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Gravity, Recycle</p>",
